rward to the Underwater Zombie King that can do the German suplex in episode 9. He got injected with Virus Ж plus an extra 3L of T-rex embryo in the easter egg after the credit. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Damn I just love biopunk. Love it..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G11","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"UMP9","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't really get it...but you sure love this sort of stuff..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"UMP9","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's because the only difference between this piece of junk and a zombie is the fact that she does utter something intelligible every now and then. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The kind of thing you watch always puts me to sleep. \"Humans are the ultimate enemy\" is such a cliché. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I believe the sense of horror brought solely by biting and tearing and gore is the true essence of zombie films."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G11","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"UMP9","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gr G11","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't disagree, but that kind of movie is pretty much extinct, right? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Besides, it's not like we haven't experienced an actual zombie apocalypse..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G11","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"UMP9","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ugh...I've had enough of this conversation. Let's focus on the mission instead... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Are we there yet, 45?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"UMP9","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"UMP9","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"45? Say something!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"UMP9","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Huh? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Oh... We...we're almost there. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Ja, that base just ahead. Let's go."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Don't you think...45 has been a bit strange lately?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"UMP9","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You mean...how her reaction sometimes comes a bit slow?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G11","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"UMP9","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gr G11","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The brain can be the first thing to turn in a zombie..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G11","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"UMP9","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hey, that conversation is over! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"(Sighs) Maybe we should keep an eye on her condition and report it to Sier when it becomes necessary..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Fifteen minutes later."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator